1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 17=

34
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,760
Considering our past friendship,

35
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,760
I can't bring myself to kill you.

36
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:02,880
Instead,

37
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:03,960
I'll give you to the Merfolk King

38
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,240
as a snack to go with his wine.

39
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,560
Bye now.

40
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,640
After eating you,

41
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,560
I can ascend to immortality.

42
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,720
The heavenly wine and nectar

43
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:18,800
must taste a hundred times better
than anything in the mortal world.

44
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,320
No, no.

45
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,120
What are you doing?

46
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,160
I'll activate it and suck him inside.

47
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,120
You can't!

48
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,760
We'll get sucked in too.

49
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,360
Huh?

50
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,640
Once we're trapped inside the pagoda,

51
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,160
there'll be no way out.

52
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,840
Ah!

53
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,040
Wow!

54
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,560
You can't even tell I was injured.

55
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,400
Your sweetheart

56
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:40,040
would be stunned

57
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:40,920
if he saw you

58
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,240
like this.

59
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,640
Really?

60
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,120
What kind of rouge is this?

61
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,600
I love this color.

62
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,760
This is my family's Rouge Snow.

63
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,640
Rouge Snow?

64
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:53,560
Listen,

65
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,360
don't worry.

66
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:56,320
This is just what I had left.

67
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,600
It's the only one I have.

68
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,760
If you like it,

69
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,320
you can have it.

70
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,720
Oh,

71
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:03,960
I couldn't possibly.

72
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:12,960
Ling'er.

73
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,640
How is it going?

74
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,960
Elder Jigong needs your help

75
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,520
to prepare the antidote.

76
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,760
I'll take care of things here.

77
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:23,720
Oh.

78
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,320
It's fine.

79
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,120
I'll go check on him first.

80
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,040
I'll be back soon.

81
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,400
You've worked hard.

82
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,520
Let me pour you some tea.

83
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,360
Finally,

84
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,200
no one can get in my way anymore.

85
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,000
Shh.

86
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:08,920
I knew something was off.

87
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,920
That monk had no reason

88
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,920
to ask me for help.

89
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,320
Aren't you on their side?

90
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,360
I'm a fox!

91
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,360
Don't be afraid.

92
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:21,960
I'm not going to hurt you.

93
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,920
A demon should act like a demon.

94
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,920
Why pretend to be a good person
like a monk?

95
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,360
I'll send you on your way first!

96
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,600
I'll hold him off.

97
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:39,400
You go first.

98
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:39,960
Okay.

99
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,200
You won't get away.

100
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,520
No!

101
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,800
Don't kill her!

102
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,280
My benefactor...

103
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,720
My benefactor...

104
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,640
I'm not here to take her life.

105
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,200
I only want to take out

106
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,760
what's inside her belly.

107
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,400
Who are you?

108
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:15,320
Why do you want to take

109
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:17,240
the child of my husband and me?

110
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,640
Child?

111
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:21,240
Since when did we have a child?

112
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:25,200
Shen Lang?

113
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:26,560
He's a demon.

114
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:32,000
Last night, I used a potion

115
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,960
to activate the pearl inside you.

116
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,360
I'll take that pearl out myself

117
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:39,160
and make the Ke family pay
for their sins.

118
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:42,320
How could there be a pearl inside me?

119
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,200
Shen Lang,

120
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,320
what are you talking about?

121
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,760
Don't scare me.

122
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,960
Because your father

123
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,760
had you with the Clam Spirit Princess.

124
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:51,760
What?

125
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,840
Nineteen years ago,

126
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,920
your father went out to sea to fish.

127
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,000
He was caught in a storm

128
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,200
and nearly lost his life.

129
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,800
The Clam Spirit Princess,

130
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,840
to save your father,

131
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,320
revealed her true identity

132
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:04,440
Later, your father

133
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,720
deceived the princess,

134
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:07,720
promising her eternal love

135
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,520
and had you with her.

136
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,760
After that, your father learned that

137
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,000
the Clam Spirit clan

138
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,360
all carried a rare pearl
of great value within them.

139
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:17,120
When a Clam Spirit died,

140
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,760
their people would

141
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,480
take those pearls

142
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,160
and make them into the uniquely
fragrant Rouge Snow.

143
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,040
But your father,

144
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:26,240
for fame and fortune,

145
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,040
drugged the princess,

146
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,160
cut open her belly,

147
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:32,760
and stole her pearl.

148
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,760
He used Rouge Snow

149
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,000
to build his fortune,

150
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,640
bringing countless fishermen

151
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,720
to harvest pearls.

152
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,760
That drove the Clam Spirit clan
to near extinction.

153
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,560
Because of this,

154
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:45,120
the princess was gravely injured.

155
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:47,640
Not long after,

156
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,040
she passed away.

157
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,320
The princess

158
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,560
was the love of my life.

159
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:58,040
She was the one I was meant to marry.

160
00:06:58,640 --> 00:06:59,160
What...

161
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,360
What did you say?

162
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,960
I could have easily killed you
and your father.

163
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,920
But no,

164
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,600
I want what happened to the princess

165
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,520
to happen to you all over again!

166
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,960
I want your father

167
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,920
and everyone who loves Rouge Snow

168
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,400
to die because of it.

169
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,600
That's why I pretended to get close
to you.

170
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,280
I even tricked your father

171
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,320
into searching for herbs

172
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,360
to replace the pearls in Rouge Snow.

173
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,160
But those herbs

174
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:26,000
were actually the Soul-Loss Powder
I prepared.

175
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,440
No...

176
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,320
I don't believe this is true.

177
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:31,640
You don't believe me?

178
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,000
Wait until I dig it out

179
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,320
and see it with your own eyes.

180
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,240
Stop!

181
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,560
Arhat Heaven-Turning Seal!

182
00:07:45,119 --> 00:07:45,685
Everyone, get back!

183
00:07:45,705 --> 00:07:47,191
Don't let the innocent get hurt!

184
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,520
Your spiritual power returned?

185
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:52,920
No.

186
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,920
I was just trying to scare you.

187
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,920
I never expected that you
and the Ke family

188
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:58,200
would have such a tragic connection.

189
00:07:58,520 --> 00:07:59,720
You heard everything?

190
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,160
Every single word.

191
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,920
Impossible.

192
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,360
You have no spiritual power.

193
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,240
And with only her help,

194
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,050
how did you manage

195
00:08:08,050 --> 00:08:08,760
to escape from the Merfolk King?

196
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,040
I have the Three-Headed Jiao
to thank for that.

197
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,120
The Merfolk King

198
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,200
is actually sworn brothers with him.

199
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,360
He was afraid that if he ate me,

200
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,640
the higher-ups would...

201
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,920
so he let me go.

202
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,320
What happened to my benefactor?

203
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,760
My benefactor!

204
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:26,960
He's fine.

205
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:27,520
My benefactor!

206
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:28,440
He just

207
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,760
loves drinking.

208
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:32,200
After having a couple of drinks
with the Merfolk King,

209
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,200
he passed out.

210
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,840
He really can't hold his liquor!

211
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,800
So what if you escaped?

212
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,400
A powerless man like you,

213
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,640
and that little demon of yours,

214
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,720
you've only come here to die.

215
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:42,360
He said you are a demon.

216
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,400
I told you, I'm a celestial maiden.

217
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,040
Take Ms. Ke away first.

218
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,120
I'll handle things here.

219
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,240
No need.

220
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:53,840
Just watch me perform.

221
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:58,720
Monk.

222
00:08:58,800 --> 00:08:59,520
Your turn.

223
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,520
Don't be afraid.

224
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,760
Arhat

225
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:02,760
Soul-Loss Powder!

226
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,360
Soul-Loss Powder?

227
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:08,000
How do you have Soul-Loss Powder?

228
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:08,760
Sorry.

229
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:09,720
I forgot to tell you.

230
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,160
The Merfolk King

231
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,360
and I are sworn brothers now.

232
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,920
He gave this to me.

233
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:17,160
Come on.

234
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:17,920
Piaopiao.

235
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,200
Die!

236
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:22,920
No!

237
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,720
Ah!

238
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,400
Ah!

239
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:57,520
Oh...

240
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:58,680
What...

241
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,120
Come on.

242
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,200
Slow down.

243
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,440
I never expected this.

244
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,400
You little fox.

245
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:07,240
You actually risked everything

246
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:09,200
to protect someone else.

247
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,080
Were you

248
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,680
touched by my kindness?

249
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:14,840
Of course I was.

250
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,440
Then let my benefactor go,

251
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,280
and take me as your disciple.

252
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:19,320
Save it.

253
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,720
He was about to kill you.

254
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,320
Why did you still save him?

255
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,080
He had his reasons.

256
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,320
The blame

257
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:31,200
should fall on my father and me
for what we did first.

258
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,480
Please don't make things difficult
for him.

259
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,800
Even if you kill me,

260
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,880
it won't change anything.

261
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,880
Since you became sworn brothers
with the Merfolk King,

262
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,640
he should have told you.

263
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,480
Merfolk and clam spirits

264
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,720
depend on each other to survive.

265
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:48,240
The poison of the merfolk

266
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,680
can only be cured
by a clam spirit's pearl.

267
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,920
If you want to save him,

268
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:55,040
you must take the pearl from inside her.

269
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,600
In the end,

270
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,320
I still won.

271
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:04,800
Princess.

272
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,240
I've avenged you.

273
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,640
Shen Lang.

274
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,600
Shen Lang.

275
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:21,720
Don't die.

276
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,240
Ayao.

277
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,320
I'm sorry.

278
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,400
I had to avenge the princess.

279
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,520
The truth is, my feelings for you...

280
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,480
If I weren't who I am,

281
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,440
and you weren't who you are,

282
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:49,680
perhaps I really could have been
your husband,

283
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,320
and stayed with you.

284
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:56,720
Shen Lang!

285
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,800
Shen Lang!

286
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:08,230
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

287
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:11,490
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

288
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:15,290
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

289
00:12:15,340 --> 00:12:18,320
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

290
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:25,530
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

291
00:12:25,550 --> 00:12:29,080
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

292
00:12:35,790 --> 00:12:38,990
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

293
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:42,250
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

294
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:45,560
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

295
00:12:45,570 --> 00:12:47,250
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

296
00:12:47,290 --> 00:12:49,170
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

297
00:12:49,210 --> 00:12:50,730
♪I left my wife behind♪

298
00:12:50,870 --> 00:12:52,330
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

299
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:56,150
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

300
00:12:56,210 --> 00:12:57,290
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

301
00:12:57,300 --> 00:12:59,390
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

302
00:12:59,430 --> 00:13:01,090
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

303
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:02,960
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

304
00:13:02,990 --> 00:13:06,320
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

305
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:09,590
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

306
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:12,720
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

307
00:13:12,740 --> 00:13:16,090
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

308
00:13:16,140 --> 00:13:19,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

309
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:23,100
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

310
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:26,210
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

311
00:13:26,790 --> 00:13:29,840
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

312
00:13:29,860 --> 00:13:33,280
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

313
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:36,840
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

314
00:13:36,860 --> 00:13:40,320
♪You're just wasting your time♪

315
00:13:40,370 --> 00:13:43,290
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

316
00:13:43,340 --> 00:13:44,950
♪And I just laugh happily♪

317
00:13:44,980 --> 00:13:48,360
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

